{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489795,"name":"TURTLE","username":"TURTLE1","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/5fc32e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:44:53.837Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489795-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489795-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489795-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489795-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot repeatedly loses connection during active sessions on Windows. It suddenly switches to “Reconnecting” and displays:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Showing saved messages”\u003cbr\u003e\n“This conversation may be out of date and will refresh when the connection returns.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis happens frequently while I am actively using Grok Bot, not just when initially starting a session. Reconnecting can take a significant amount of time, and retrying does not always resolve it immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489795-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489795-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows.\u003cbr\u003e\nStart or continue a conversation/session.\u003cbr\u003e\nUse Grok Bot normally for an extended session.\u003cbr\u003e\nDuring the session, Grok Bot will sometimes suddenly lose its connection.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe app displays “Reconnecting” and “Showing saved messages.”\u003cbr\u003e\nWait for the connection to return or attempt to retry/reconnect.\u003cbr\u003e\nIn some cases, reconnection takes a long time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489795-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489795-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot should maintain a stable connection throughout an active session without unexpectedly disconnecting or getting stuck in the “Reconnecting” state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489795-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489795-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/d/6da482afd629afc23c41e14398db0726fec20f6c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/fDWvoyWJpa0rVxSq8OqezsHNFus.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 131001.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/d/6da482afd629afc23c41e14398db0726fec20f6c.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 131001.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"fDWvoyWJpa0rVxSq8OqezsHNFus\" width=\"531\" height=\"195\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-13 131001.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e531×195 10.6 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/4/04c46e1ccd0d5b550843feac0182166bd6a141d9.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/GaL5tedDI7nllcBsUHPyVF9j1D.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 130446.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollo